The SKILL.md template's three route surfaces — the job bullets, the trigger table, and the browse-by-mode list — name section paths and heading anchors in the sibling templates they route to, so a section that is renamed, moved, or refocused, or a heading whose text changes, silently falsifies its route entry unless the entry moves in the same edit. The rendered per-platform trees are generated output and sit under .wikiignore, so the templates are the only editable side and wiki check no longer validates these fragment links.
